{"id":1483,"title":"列表、元组和集合","summary":"列表、元组和集合","tags":"","components":[{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"fe0f4cb6-ef02-3ccb-90ff-2bf30cef3992","knowledge_id":165,"title":"列表、元组和集合","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":0,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":165,"title":"列表、元组和集合","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"06c7d55e-065d-3cf0-843a-b9e458b7c742","title":"","title_html":"","text":"**列表**:\n\n列表是数据的集合，且有顺序。它与数组类似，但可以存储不同类型的数据。\n\n**例如：**","text_html":"<p><strong>列表</strong>:</p>\n<p>列表是数据的集合，且有顺序。它与数组类似，但可以存储不同类型的数据。</p>\n<p><strong>例如：</strong></p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"805d8403-ae3e-30fa-9c6b-cc4767ce50f8","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"# 列表可以容纳不同类型的数据\nvalues = [5, 'John', 19.25]","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":false,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"b9015cf1-37b4-3472-82bf-dd10fcd0c4d7","title":"","title_html":"","text":"使用方括号 `[]` 定义一个列表。Python中的列表是**可变的**，也就是说，可以对列表进行添加元素、查找元素、删除元素和修改元素。\n\n列表中的元素是有序的，可以使用索引来访问。\n\n**元组**:\n\n元组与列表类似，**但不可变**。这意味着元组中的元素不能更改、添加或删除。\n\n**例如：**","text_html":"<p>使用方括号 <code>[]</code> 定义一个列表。Python中的列表是<strong>可变的</strong>，也就是说，可以对列表进行添加元素、查找元素、删除元素和修改元素。</p>\n<p>列表中的元素是有序的，可以使用索引来访问。</p>\n<p><strong>元组</strong>:</p>\n<p>元组与列表类似，<strong>但不可变</strong>。这意味着元组中的元素不能更改、添加或删除。</p>\n<p><strong>例如：</strong></p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":2},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"34d3e1b6-663d-3f85-8383-8edbe1fd9b29","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"values = (5, 'John', 19.25)","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":false,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":3},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"41e670e9-5f98-312e-9081-ee27fb24b798","title":"","title_html":"","text":"我们使用括号`()`来定义元组。\n\n**集合**:\n\n集合也类似于列表。不过，集合不允许元素重复，且无元素不保证顺序。\n\n**例如：**","text_html":"<p>我们使用括号<code>()</code>来定义元组。</p>\n<p><strong>集合</strong>:</p>\n<p>集合也类似于列表。不过，集合不允许元素重复，且无元素不保证顺序。</p>\n<p><strong>例如：</strong></p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":4},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"5cc124f7-46a5-3325-a3b8-71db38c08f1f","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"# 错误：存在重复元素2\nvalues = {1, 2, 4, 2}\n\n# 有效的集合，无重复元素\nvalues = {1, 2, 3, 4}","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":false,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":5},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"1f38533f-5979-39a5-b308-f09f5d79f83f","title":"","title_html":"","text":"我们使用大括号`{}`来定义集合。\n\n集合中的元素是**无序的**，这意味着不能使用索引访问它们。","text_html":"<p>我们使用大括号<code>{}</code>来定义集合。</p>\n<p>集合中的元素是<strong>无序的</strong>，这意味着不能使用索引访问它们。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":6}]}}],"status":"undo","course_no":"027","source_url":"https://edu.py2fun.com/api/course/027/page/1483"}
